uenced, cumulative, multisensory, and responsive classroom routines.", "children": [{"id": "68f46f4a-3a52-4e1c-94c2-648ecfdda834", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Structured literacy principles", "children": [{"id": "68e1dc01-70ee-4aa8-b8f6-d78d27a57c0a", "type": "concept", "title": "Explicit instruction"}, {"id": "48d150c1-b79a-41af-a6b1-cb47f1eb2008", "type": "concept", "title": "Systematic sequence"}, {"id": "ae83d47a-0580-45c4-b7c9-869a3aa5a9f5", "type": "concept", "title": "Cumulative review"}, {"id": "819270f7-198e-40bf-9d35-8c1e9d901614", "type": "concept", "title": "Diagnostic teaching"}], "description": "Structured literacy is explicit, systematic, cumulative, diagnostic, and responsive."}, {"id": "e79472a2-1699-4cb0-b7d4-42ae7bbbf051", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Lesson architecture", "children": [{"id": "c8eca3e8-45cf-4a5d-b78d-23b81d9de64c", "type": "concept", "title": "Warm-up review"}, {"id": "4a810e31-db31-46b4-8ae2-f7f4c4349bdc", "type": "concept", "title": "New pattern"}, {"id": "55197638-13a0-46dd-a778-6a7eef619136", "type": "concept", "title": "Word reading"}, {"id": "d4c806b9-270e-4330-aca9-92a552cb95e9", "type": "concept", "title": "Sentence and text reading"}], "description": "Strong lessons blend review, new learning, guided practice, connected text, and application."}, {"id": "b239f366-3d7e-4913-bdf6-92920fd2dd63", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Multisensory and responsive practice", "children": [{"id": "d28dad9a-75da-430d-b925-23c8896b52f8", "type": "concept", "title": "Saying sounds"}, {"id": "b8343a9e-515b-4100-9546-faa4bd8d8b6f", "type": "concept", "title": "Writing graphemes"}, {"id": "e612181e-956f-4af0-9f4f-58ff4c3457a5", "type": "concept", "title": "Manipulatives"}, {"id": "7d3345ec-5146-470c-996e-ec0ebfed3710", "type": "concept", "title": "Immediate corrective feedback"}], "description": "Multisensory routines can support attention and memory when tied to clear language and print goals."}]}, {"id": "97eb40e2-e6a5-4b81-a5b9-6db475ac578