ows whether intervention is working and when to adjust instruction."}]}, {"id": "0c33f314-509b-4f00-a3fb-05ca0388929b", "type": "topic", "title": "Dyslexia, Reading Difficulties, and Evidence-Based Intervention", "description": "Understand reading difficulty profiles and match intervention intensity, content, and progress monitoring.", "children": [{"id": "b23fc099-fd2b-4008-a60d-6362b435e5e5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Dyslexia and word-level reading", "children": [{"id": "1b9547bf-8803-40b0-93a6-fcbd950cf0b9", "type": "concept", "title": "Accurate and fluent word reading"}, {"id": "2b3a52e6-b0fc-4d3a-a9aa-99b63f07fff4", "type": "concept", "title": "Spelling"}, {"id": "3dd1353d-88c4-4bd1-bff2-519cb11249ed", "type": "concept", "title": "Phonological processing"}, {"id": "f420ab0a-8c40-4c12-b371-7c0f8f25fc0c", "type": "concept", "title": "Family history and early indicators"}], "description": "Dyslexia is commonly linked to word-level reading and spelling difficulties, often involving phonological processing."}, {"id": "240dbb60-20cb-4a0a-8b22-78d79bc813cd", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Intervention design", "children": [{"id": "8b21f350-1996-42ce-a3ca-229fdc8c15a6", "type": "concept", "title": "Tiered support"}, {"id": "ee54c303-00bb-4a37-b68a-b2b93fff6bc7", "type": "concept", "title": "Small-group instruction"}, {"id": "ad01d946-164b-4689-bc7d-fc840f6af3a8", "type": "concept", "title": "Cumulative review"}, {"id": "8994a485-7b2e-4c27-ac01-aa95fd246ff1", "type": "concept", "title": "Mastery checks"}], "description": "Intervention should be explicit, targeted, sufficiently intensive, and monitored."}, {"id": "4a1721de-5da7-4edf-9318-a8e653f9bcad", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Collaboration and communication", "children": [{"id": "fe533ea9-81dc-468d-884d-5c1f42145d29", "type": "concept", "title": "Family communication"}, {"id": "6774744d-1b71-45fe-857c-bcb176eaa969", "type": "concept", "title": "Special education referral"}, {"id": "d90428ed-7016-41cb-8bef-ff73a